### Check one email
GET https://YOUR-API-ADDRESS/v1/verify?email=sample.user@example.com

### Check one email (POST)
POST https://YOUR-API-ADDRESS/v1/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "sample.user@gmial.com" }

### Check a batch (up to 50 without a key, 500 with one)
POST https://YOUR-API-ADDRESS/v1/verify/batch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR-API-KEY

{ "emails": ["sample.user@example.com", "hello@mailinator.com", "info@github.com"] }

### Check a domain
GET https://YOUR-API-ADDRESS/v1/domain?domain=example.com
